Copyleft components (GPL-3.0 / MPL-2.0)
----------------------------------------

The following grammars come from copyleft-licensed upstream repositories.
gotreesitter's own code stays MIT; these entries mark where a downstream
consumer that embeds gotreesitter takes on GPL-3.0 or MPL-2.0 obligations for
the affected grammar. See docs/licensing.md for what that means and for the
`gotreesitter_no_copyleft` build tag, which excludes the hand-ported
caddy/disassembly/nim external scanner sources and removes all four grammars
(caddy, disassembly, jq, nim) from the public grammar registry.

  - caddy        https://github.com/opa-oz/tree-sitter-caddy  (GPL-3.0)
  - disassembly  https://github.com/ColinKennedy/tree-sitter-disassembly  (GPL-3.0)
  - jq           https://github.com/nverno/tree-sitter-jq  (GPL-3.0)
  - nim          https://github.com/alaviss/tree-sitter-nim  (MPL-2.0)

